weigher judge god~
the Weigher~
You resist the urge to avert your eyes from the Weigher at the end of the road.
~
The sight is different for every soul, a mirror held up to what each pilgrim
truly is. At first a proud and bitter old judge; just as easily a gentle
open hand, a smile, and gardens... gardens.
~
