wisp sprite mocking~
the mocking wisp~
A mocking wisp dances in and out of the air before your eyes, taunting you.
~
The pilgrims say the wisps are the souls of liars, bound to the road to lie
to those who walk it. They promise shortcuts, wishes, easy ways. To you it
looks like nothing more than an annoying little sprite of light.
~
