#1509
oduran prince ascetic~
Prince Oduran~
Prince Oduran the Ascetic sits here in rags, washing blood from his hands in a silver bowl.
~
Thin as a rake, in a coarse wool tunic, he has not bathed in months nor
eaten in days. His people thought him a saint. The water in his bowl never
runs clear, and his smile is still so charming.
~
