cassel betrayer~
Cassel the Betrayer~
The Betrayer approaches slowly, holding out his arms in an embrace.
~
Cassel walked beside Oswen the First Pilgrim for years, and sold him for a
purse of silver. You see nothing in his face but the sadness of a man who
would sell the road itself.
~
